nd to proceed?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2801346564/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2821721135","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105364#issuecomment-2821721135","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105364","id":2821721135,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oMAwv","user":{"login":"The-Cyber-Captain","id":141319868,"node_id":"U_kgDOCGxevA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141319868?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Cyber-Captain","html_url":"https://github.com/The-Cyber-Captain","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Cyber-Captain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Cyber-Captain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Cyber-Captain/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Cyber-Captain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Cyber-Captain/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Cyber-Captain/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Cyber-Captain/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Cyber-Captain/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Cyber-Captain/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T15:35:13Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T16:46:38Z","body":"Okay, I tried activating the cloned Actions workflow on my fork to pre-check things (like spelling prefs) before PR... but that didn't seem to give much / any joy. As I'd assumed previously, that workflow appears to want to go build the engine across multiple platforms, etc. (And fails in *my* github env for sure on multiple fronts and platforms I don't understand, or want to understand. LOL.)\r\n\r\nSo, despite the prior error hinting the official Godot repo Actions were going to automatically swap out \"dialogue\" for \"dialog\" here, I instead took a punt, did it by hand and the magical background checks now all pass. (y)\r\n\r\nBeen doing all this via web - as I didn't come at things as a Dev task initially, just a docs update / housekeeping [Being also, typically, off-grid or at best in VR. Yay for needless complexity on my part! //facepalm]. And AFAIK, there's no way to rebase or amend from the github UI itself. Boooo! (But, also, Yay... fair call in *most* cases).\r\n\r\nCurrently have the opportunity today to fetch my fork local and attempt a rebase on the commits now, which - fingers crossed - will trickle through here and give a nice clean PR to approve? Stay tuned.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2821721135/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2828815643","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105364#issuecomment-2828815643","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105364","id":2828815643,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6onE0b","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/o